---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Upgrades leptoskit.toml to the current configuration schema

Usage: leptoskit migrate [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --file <FILE>  A specific file; otherwise finds the nearest leptoskit.toml
      --dry-run      Print the migrated TOML without writing it
      --check        Fail when migration is needed, without writing the file
  -h, --help         Print help
  -V, --version      Print version
